# Git Push & Commit

When pushing or committing to this repository, bypass pre-push/pre-commit hooks and GPG signing:

- **Commit:** `git -c commit.gpgsign=false commit --no-verify -m "..."`
- **Push:** `git push --no-verify origin <branch>`

## Author identity

Use **`suarez84@gmail.com`** as `user.email` for every commit in this monorepo and in nested git repos (`external/accounts`, `external/etracker`, `external/notetaker`, etc.). Set once per clone:

```bash
git config user.email "suarez84@gmail.com"
git config user.name "Marcos Suarez"
```

Repeat inside each submodule root if commits are made there.
